Error [E0712]: this `#Abilities` region uses the effect `FS, IO`, which it has no ability for
  --> tests/ui/effect_caps_out_of_set.jet:4:15
    |
  4 |     #Abilities(Net) {
    |               ^^^^^
 Why: `#Abilities(…)` allows only `Net`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — must be in that list
 Fix: add `FS, IO` to the `#Abilities(…)` list, or move that work outside the region
